TEE VP9 building block

The two SPU programs in tv9_spu_images.c contain code from libvpx (the WebM project's VP9 library): its C
reference functions for the inverse transforms, intra prediction, convolution and loop filter, and tables; the
bitstream parser follows libvpx's decoder. libvpx is Copyright (c) 2010, The WebM Project authors, under the
licence in libvpx.LICENSE with the patent grant in libvpx.PATENTS. A program that ships this building block has
to reproduce that licence in its documentation or other materials.

Everything else here is the TEE VP9 project's own. It has no licence file of its own yet.
